    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The sampling rate must be at least twice the voice bandwidth (Nyquist rate): 2 \u00d7 3 kHz = 6 kHz. Each sample requires log\u2082(16) = 4 bits. Thus, each voice signal needs 6,000 \u00d7 4 = 24,000 bps. With a 1 \u03bcs bit interval, the channel bit rate is 1 / 1\u00d710\u207b\u2076 = 1 Mbps. Number of signals = 1,000,000 / 24,000 \u2248 41.67 \u2192 closest option is 45.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
