    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The steady-state plasma concentration (Css) is calculated using the formula: Css = Infusion rate / Clearance.  \nInfusion rate = 1.6 mg/min, Clearance = 640 mL/min = 0.64 L/min, so Css = 1.6 / 640 = 0.0025 mg/mL \u2192 0.0025 mg/mL \u2248 0.002 mg/mL.  \nOption B contains \"trig/mL\", which is not a valid unit, making it incorrect.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
