      "generated_answer": "The study compares antecolic vs. retrocolic duodenojejunostomy in *pylorus-preserving* pancreaticoduodenectomy (PPPD), but does not compare pylorus-preserving vs. pylorus-removing techniques. Therefore, it provides no direct evidence about whether delayed gastric emptying is related to pylorus preservation itself.\n\nThe observed DGE incidence (12%) and its association with other complications do not address the role of pylorus preservation specifically.\n\nGiven the lack of comparative data involving pylorus removal, the relationship remains unassessed by this study.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
