      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}  \nRapid prescreening (RPS) detected 39 out of 107 glandular cell abnormalities (36.4%), and importantly, 11 additional AGC cases were identified *only* by RPS and missed by full screening\u2014indicating RPS does detect some glandular abnormalities, though not all. While sensitivity is suboptimal, the data confirm detection occurs.",
