      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}  \nThe study demonstrates that IV opioid PCT significantly reduced breathlessness (P < 0.01) with high patient satisfaction (12/12 confirmed relief), stable physiology, and feasibility in palliative care. These findings support PCT as a viable new therapeutic concept for opioid administration in refractory breathlessness.",
