      "generated_answer": "If the person chooses the door with the lady behind it, he must marry her immediately as a reward for his innocence. The marriage takes place in the arena, with a priest, choristers, and dancing maidens celebrating the event. No prior relationships or personal preferences are considered by the king.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{He must marry the lady immediately.}}",
