      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}\n\nThomas Paine emphasizes individual reason and personal belief, rejecting organized religion while affirming moral principles. His statement \"My own mind is my own church\" reflects Enlightenment values of autonomy and rational inquiry. This aligns with many Enlightenment intellectuals who championed individual judgment over institutional dogma.",
