    "prediction": "gemini-2.5-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    n, m = map(int, input().split())\n    edges = []\n    for _ in range(m):\n        u, v = map(int, input().split())\n        edges.append((u, v))\n    \n    k = int(input())\n    forbidden = []\n    for _ in range(k):\n        x, y = map(int, input().split())\n        forbidden.append((x, y))\n    \n    q = int(input())\n    queries = []\n    for _ in range(q):\n        p, q = map(int, input().split())\n        queries.append((p, q))\n    \n    def is_good(graph):\n        def bfs(start, end, graph):\n            visited = set()\n            queue = [start]\n            visited.add(start)\n            \n            while queue:\n                curr = queue.pop(0)\n                if curr == end:\n                    return True\n                \n                for neighbor in graph.get(curr, []):\n                    if neighbor not in visited:\n                        visited.add(neighbor)\n                        queue.append(neighbor)\n            return False\n        \n        for x, y in forbidden:\n            if bfs(x, y, graph):\n                return False\n        return True\n    \n    for p, q in queries:\n        new_edges = edges + [(p, q)]\n        graph = {}\n        for u, v in new_edges:\n            if u not in graph:\n                graph[u] = []\n            if v not in graph:\n                graph[v] = []\n            graph[u].append(v)\n            graph[v].append(u)\n        \n        if is_good(graph):\n            print(\"Yes\")\n        else:\n            print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
