      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    n, m = map(int, input().split())\n    edges = []\n    for _ in range(m):\n        line = list(map(int, input().split()))\n        k = line[0]\n        c = line[1]\n        subset = line[2:]\n        for i in range(k):\n            for j in range(i + 1, k):\n                u = subset[i]\n                v = subset[j]\n                edges.append((u, v, c))\n    \n    parent = list(range(n + 1))\n    \n    def find(i):\n        if parent[i] == i:\n            return i\n        parent[i] = find(parent[i])\n        return parent[i]\n    \n    def union(i, j):\n        root_i = find(i)\n        root_j = find(j)\n        if root_i != root_j:\n            parent[root_i] = root_j\n            return True\n        return False\n    \n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: x[2])\n    \n    mst_weight = 0\n    mst_edges = 0\n    \n    for u, v, weight in edges:\n        if union(u, v):\n            mst_weight += weight\n            mst_edges += 1\n            \n    if mst_edges != n - 1:\n        print(\"-1\")\n    else:\n        print(mst_weight)\n\nsolve()\n```",
