    "prediction": "gemini-2.5-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef count_ways(n: int, x: int) -> int:\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    \n    def solve(remaining_n: int, current_num: int) -> int:\n        if remaining_n == 0:\n            return 1\n        if remaining_n < 0:\n            return 0\n        \n        power_of_num = current_num ** x\n        if power_of_num > n:\n            return 0\n        \n        take_num = solve(remaining_n - power_of_num, current_num + 1) % MOD\n        skip_num = solve(remaining_n, current_num + 1) % MOD\n        \n        return (take_num + skip_num) % MOD\n    \n    return solve(n, 1)\n```",
