      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countPrefixSuffixPairs(words):\n    def isPrefixAndSuffix(str1, str2):\n        return str2.startswith(str1) and str2.endswith(str1)\n    \n    count = 0\n    n = len(words)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if isPrefixAndSuffix(words[i], words[j]):\n                count += 1\n    return count\n```",
