      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countSubMultisets(nums, l, r):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    freq = {}\n    for num in nums:\n        freq[num] = freq.get(num, 0) + 1\n    \n    dp = [0] * (r + 1)\n    dp[0] = 1\n    \n    for num, count in freq.items():\n        new_dp = dp[:]\n        for remainder in range(num):\n            total_count = 0\n            for j in range(remainder, r + 1, num):\n                total_count = (total_count + dp[j]) % MOD\n                if j >= num * (count + 1):\n                    total_count = (total_count - dp[j - num * (count + 1)]) % MOD\n                new_dp[j] = (new_dp[j] + total_count - dp[j]) % MOD\n        dp = new_dp\n\n    result = 0\n    for i in range(l, r + 1):\n        result = (result + dp[i]) % MOD\n    return result\n```",
