    "prediction": "gemini-2.5-flash",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef count_sub_multisets(nums, l, r):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    count_zero = nums.count(0)\n    nums = [num for num in nums if num != 0]\n    max_sum = sum(nums)\n    if max_sum == 0 and l == 0:\n        return (count_zero > 0)\n    if max_sum == 0 and l > 0:\n        return 0\n    dp = [0] * (max_sum + 1)\n    dp[0] = 1\n    for num in nums:\n        for i in range(num, max_sum + 1):\n            dp[i] = (dp[i] + dp[i - num]) % MOD\n    ans = 0\n    for i in range(l, r + 1):\n        ans = (ans + dp[i]) % MOD\n    ans = (ans * pow(2, count_zero, MOD)) % MOD\n    return ans\n```",
