    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minGroups(nums):\n    from collections import Counter\n    count = Counter(nums)\n    frequencies = list(count.values())\n    \n    def canFormGroups(groups):\n        total = sum(frequencies)\n        if total % groups != 0:\n            return False\n        target = total // groups\n        extra = total % groups\n        for freq in frequencies:\n            if freq > target + (1 if extra > 0 else 0):\n                return False\n            extra -= 1 if freq > target else 0\n        return True\n    \n    left, right = 1, len(frequencies)\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if canFormGroups(mid):\n            right = mid\n        else:\n            left = mid + 1\n    return left\n```",
