      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef minGroupsForValidAssignment(nums):\n    freq = list(Counter(nums).values())\n    total_indices = len(nums)\n    \n    def is_valid(groups):\n        avg = total_indices // groups\n        remainder = total_indices % groups\n        small_size = avg\n        large_size = avg + 1\n        needed = (groups - remainder) * small_size + remainder * large_size\n        if needed != total_indices:\n            return False\n        count_assignable = 0\n        for f in freq:\n            found = False\n            for x in range(f + 1):\n                y = f - x\n                if x % small_size == 0 and y % large_size == 0 and x // small_size + y // large_size <= groups:\n                    count_assignable += f\n                    found = True\n                    break\n                if small_size == large_size:\n                    break\n            if not found:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    for k in range(1, total_indices + 1):\n        if is_valid(k):\n            return k\n    return total_indices\n```",
